              "lines": [
                "**How to interpret this page**\n",
                "\n",
                "Validation compares Gold outputs with independent PySpark calculations and Python population statistics. PASS describes the recorded validation execution; it does not establish upstream source completeness or the success of later workflow attempts.\n",
                "\n",
                "Snapshot completion time is separate from validation time. Source year ranges describe available observations and may contain gaps.\n",
                "\n",
                "Population is matched to BLS observations by snapshot and year. Missing matches remain NULL and are not treated as zero."
